                                "sense_id": "4d11f6dc-992d-3947-8d48-8efd35207b8a",
                                "text": "In a sly bit of casting, Tony Goldwyn — a star of the pulpy TV series “Scandal” — shows up as one of the leaders of the Christmas Adventurers Club.."
